WEBVTT

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.940
I... I...

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.960
...I'm late!

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:52.550
<i>Let's chase our dreams...</i>

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:57.700
<i>... holding hearts burning...</i>

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:02.100
<i>... like the summer sunshine.</i>

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.040
<i>If we have courage...</i>

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:09.200
<i>... at 100 miles an hour...</i>

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:17.310
<i>... I'm sure the door will open.</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:24.460
<i>Since sadness is the road</i>
<i>that leads to smiles...</i>

00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:33.100
<i>... dull, dingy shoes will</i>
<i>start to shine, too.</i>

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:39.800
<i>The most wonderful dream</i>
<i>in the world...</i>

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:46.510
<i>The pounding beat speeds up.</i>

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:53.680
<i>The eyes are prisms that</i>
<i>catch the wind...</i>

00:01:53.790 --> 00:02:01.560
<i>... and in the voices of</i>
<i>countless friends...</i>

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:08.400
<i>... I feel happiness.</i>

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:13.640
FILE. 3
LOVE'S HIGHWAY STARS

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:19.910
"Ladies' Locker Room"

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.520
Good Morning!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.920
Yoriko! Good Morning!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:27.920
Miyuki! Good Morning!

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:28.590
Good Morning.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:29.960
Oh? Where's Natsumi?

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.120
Sleeping late, as usual.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.960
You didn't wake her up?
You're living together.

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:39.290
I tried! Ice packs, firecrackers,
BB guns, headphone blasts...

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:41.670
...every day her immunity to wakeups
gets stronger and stronger.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:45.730
So, I've decided to leave
her alone from now on.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:50.080
We got days off this weekend, didn't we?
What's with these red marks?

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.110
Huh? OH!

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.110
Sorry! I couldn't help
seeing them!

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:54.420
What's today?

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.040
What's today?
Huh? It's Thursday.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:59.350
I completely forgot about replying!
What should I do?!

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:03.480
Weekend? "Reply?"
This is fishy!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:09.020
There! I made it! No
thanks to Miyuki!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.730
Natsumi! Good morning!

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:12.830
Oh... Morning!

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:17.900
What's with that laugh? A-ha! I bet
you're onto something juicy again!

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:19.740
Wanna know?

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:22.040
I heard that Yoriko saw the evidence!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.980
That poor Nakajima!

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:25.350
You think Miyuki hears her clock ticking?

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.950
Wouldn't you want to try it, even once?

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:27.650
Try what once?

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:28.980
Oh come on, you know what!

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.550
You mean Nakajima wasn't #1 on her list?

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.680
I never thought that this would happen!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:36.950
Good mornin'! Huh? What the?
What's with those faces?!

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:40.360
Nakajima, I've got something to talk to
you about. Come with me for a sec.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.200
Huh?!

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.930
Kennie!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:47.500
Come with me!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.770
Ugh! Lemme go!

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.400
Shut up!

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:59.910
An "Omiai?!" But you don't
know that for sure, right?

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.280
This is no time to act
so laid back!

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:05.440
A weekend meeting that
requires an RSVP...

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.520
Can it be anything other than a formal
Omiai matchmaking introduction?

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:13.120
See! It's all your fault for not telling
her how you really feel about her!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:15.990
Whatcha gonna do now?!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:20.360
This means... you're gonna have
to kidnap her... or else!

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:21.830
K... Kidnap her?!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.000
Don't you care if some guy
steals her away?!

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:26.570
Take her away?! You're blowing
this out of proportion...

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.970
You've got to make sure that she
doesn't make it to that meeting!

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:30.310
What do you mean by that?

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:33.910
What do you mean by that?
Hey! Nakajima! Are you a man or what?!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.610
Why can't you be a little more
direct for a change?!

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:38.010
Right! If you're a man, then go after
her until you get her or drop dead!

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.150
Now, now...

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:45.090
"Would you like to go out touring,
Ms. Kobayakawa?"

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:49.430
No, using "Ms." is weird! Hmm...
"Let's go out touring!"

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:52.760
If I'm asking her out, then I'd
better not sound so snooty!

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:55.430
"Why don't we go touring!
Huh? Huh?"

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:59.130
Ehh... Now that'll make me look like
an idiot! Maybe I should just ask...

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.740
What's wrong, Nakajima?

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:08.180
Well, umm... HUH?!
Why, that's...

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:11.520
Like it? It's Natsumi's...

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:13.620
Tsujimoto's?!

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.680
Yeah.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:17.920
She got so excited after I put the chamber
and aluminum swing-arm on it...

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:21.150
...that she ended up
driving it all night.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:23.020
But... I thought she wasn't
much of a motorhead...

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:27.600
Well, she sure can tell when something's
changed... She can be rather picky!

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:31.330
Oh, well, actually I wanted you to
check something out for me...

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.870
What is it? As long as you don't
need it done right away...

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.610
No, it can wait. I don't mind!

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:37.980
No, it can wait. I don't mind!
I do!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.380
There's no time to get excited
over bikes, am I right?!

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:44.040
You know well that I've told you to go
to bed early many, many times!

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.180
We're 15 minutes
late for patrol!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:49.320
That's not it! What are you
waiting for?! C'mon!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:52.120
Er... er... Well... Would
you like to?

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.520
What's with you two?!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:58.160
You see, Nakajima here...

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:02.170
...is trying to keep you from your Omiai,
and is therefore asking you for a date!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.700
Er... er... well...

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:09.310
He asks, "Are you free
this weekend?"

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:11.710
Weekend? This weekend?

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:13.680
Y... Yeah!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:18.340
Sorry, I have to do something
this weekend... So I can't.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:25.650
But, wait a minute here... Who said
anything about an Omiai?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:32.390
Huh?! B... But... Even Natsumi said she
had no idea about your plans, so that...

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.970
Yoriko!

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:39.970
Ah... Er... Well!

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:03.060
Oh, I don't know about this... Maybe
I'll just come home tonight.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:06.460
Gee, it's your reunion, isn't it?!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.560
Don't worry about a thing,
and just go have fun.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:13.700
But, if I'm away, who knows what kind
of rumors about me will circulate?!

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:18.300
Don't get Nakajima mixed up
in anything, okay?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.310
Are you worried about him?

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:21.110
That's NOT what I mean...

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:23.880
Okay, okay... Get going!
You'll be late!

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.780
If you see any cool classmates,
point them in my direction!

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:30.350
Well, then, I'm going.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.090
Take care... Okay?

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.230
Have a good trip!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.960
A-ha, she went to
a co-ed school...

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:56.980
Nakajima, are you here?

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.980
Oh, my! Lookin' miserable!
What's goin' on?

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:03.080
It wasn't an Omiai, so what're
you worried about?!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.790
Gee... Look, Nakajima, we all know
that you're weak sometimes...

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:08.490
...that when the going gets tough,
you don't get going...

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:13.090
...that you got no guts, are slow, and a
sissy. But, what can you do now?

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.230
You can't fight fate,
you know...

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.230
H... Hey! This
ain't helping!

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:20.810
At times like this, you've got to
release all that pent-up stress!

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.600
And I know just the
place to do that!

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:23.610
What the?

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:24.770
What the?
Oh, c'mon!

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:28.580
That poor ZXR wants you
to take her out for a ride!

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:40.720
Get your butt moving, dude!

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:42.860
You're in our way!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.470
Oh, brother...

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:54.570
Here goes!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.240
You maniac! You tryin' to
kill me or something?!

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:00.440
Nah, I'm reviving you!

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:13.120
I hope that I'll get a commendation
from the Captain for my work...

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.820
...I hope that I can keep on talking
to Tokuno every day...

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.960
...I hope my lunch-making
skills improve...

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:21.060
...I hope for more samurai
drama re-runs...

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:23.470
...and I hope the summer will be
blessed with good weather...

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:25.600
Okay, let's go buy some
lucky charms!

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:27.640
A lucky charm? What,
for "traffic safety?"

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.370
No, for a closer relationship
between you two!

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:33.210
Like the God of Love says,
"Love Shall Flourish!"

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:34.750
Give it to Miyuki, and I'm sure
it'll work out for both of you!

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:37.210
Er... No... I don't wanna
be so blunt!

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:38.620
Don't try to squirm out of this!

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.590
Don't try to squirm out of this!
It's not the "buying," it's the "giving..."

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.020
Oh, really?

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.590
So, that's how you
want it, eh?

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:49.400
"Hotel Taihei Inn"

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:50.330
"Kimizu High School Reunion"

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:51.590
Gee, long time no see!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:55.240
Miyuki?! You're looking good!

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.530
Yeah! A grown-up woman!

00:09:57.770 --> 00:10:00.260
You all look different!
I'm speechless!

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.270
Hey, Miyuki, you're a cop
now, right? Awesome!

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.380
Do you get involved in shootouts?

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:04.680
No, not really...

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:05.950
Do you get in fights with crooks?

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.150
No way!

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.320
Do you carry handcuffs and stuff?

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:09.310
W... Well, yeah...

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:20.620
Miyuki went to a co-ed
high school...

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:24.720
...that means, today's reunion...
will also feature men!

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.730
First time since graduation, eh?
Well, have some!

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:34.240
Thanks, Kido...

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:42.540
I wonder... if an old boyfriend
might show up or something!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.080
Wanna step out with
me for a while?

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.550
Huh? Kido...

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.780
That... I can't abide!
And yet...

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.400
You don't mind if Miyuki's old
boyfriend grabs her?!

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:57.970
I DO mind!

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.300
I DO mind!
Then act! What're you waiting for?!

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.600
Taihei Inn, in Katsuura...
Here we come!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.380
It's kind of embarrassing in
front of everyone, isn't it?

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.210
Why... now?

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.870
I wanted to settle things,
once and for all...

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.050
You're slow! A fly
is resting on you!

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:23.880
Shut up, you turtle!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.730
It's all in the past. I've tried
to forget all about it.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.310
Why don't we just forget
that it ever happened?

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:39.740
We can't do that!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.070
Even if you were to forget about it,
it'd always be on my mind...

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.570
This is more like it!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:56.260
Here... The lunch money
you lent me 3 years ago!

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:59.590
At last, I've paid you back!
Boy, it feels good!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.290
Gosh... You haven't
changed at all!

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:06.060
I can never tell whether
you're serious or not!

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.700
"Taihei Inn"

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:15.000
I'm sorry, but we don't have
a guest by that name.

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:16.510
This IS the Taihei Inn, isn't it?

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:17.610
Yes, it is.

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.010
This IS Katsuura City, isn't it?

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:20.610
Yes, it is.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:24.880
Er, well... Is there another
Taihei Inn in Katsuura?

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.680
We're the only one.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.450
Oh! I know! It's in Chiba!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.690
Katsuura City... in CHIBA
Prefecture!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.030
Miyuki &
Ken & Kido
Natsumi

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:41.570
N... No way...

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.900
Oh! He's dead.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.070
Well, so what's
the story?

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.120
What do you mean?

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:57.580
What do you mean?
You know... your guy. What's he like?

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.550
Is he tall? Out with it!

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.120
What's going on? What are
you talking about?

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:05.250
Get this! Satomi is dating
someone from work!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.020
Wow...

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:12.290
I wanted to go out with someone from a
different walk of life, but... I fell for him.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.160
Yeah, that happens!

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:17.100
So, it seems I didn't
need to look far.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:21.210
It'd be nice for a prince to arrive on
a white stallion, but even so...

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:26.380
Exactly! It's not like I asked
for it, but he came for me!

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:29.310
What do you mean by that, when
you're all blushed up!

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:31.720
We know about being happily in love...
it's written all over your face!

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:33.620
Oh, stop it!

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:35.550
Didn't need to look far, huh?

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:38.620
Look at you, Miyuki! What's
the meaning of that sigh?

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:39.430
Let me guess!

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.160
Let me guess!
It's nothing!

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.430
Who is he?

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:43.100
What?!

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:44.400
Just like I thought!

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:46.800
No! No! It's not like that at all!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.670
Admit it!

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:49.500
What's he like?

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:51.500
There's no one!
No one!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.160
Besides, I'm just barely
keeping up at work...

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:57.110
There's no time to date a guy or anything
like that... realistically speaking!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:00.740
Married to your work, eh? You sure
haven't changed at all, Miyuki.

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.210
You've always been
that way.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:07.290
Yeah. It was like, you weren't
interested in guys at all!

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:09.250
Instead, you talked about your
hobbies all the time!

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:11.720
You were actually popular
with the guys, you know?

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.420
So I was always thinking,
"Damn! What a waste!"

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:18.230
Miyuki wasn't interested in that, 'cause
she had goals. Right, Miyuki?

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.660
I didn't have any ambitions
like that...

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:23.460
All I thought was, "It'd be nice
if I could get married early."

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:26.730
Maybe you expect too much
from life, Miyuki.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:31.800
I bet you're waiting for someone who's
tall, totally athletic, kind, sweet...

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:36.820
...went to a top school, and makes
the big bucks. Am I right?

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:38.920
W... Well, something
like that...

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:43.490
That'd be a sight to see! I wonder what
Miyuki's significant other will be like?!

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:48.690
Look, Nakajima, everyone screws up now
and then. Besides, you're from Suzuka...

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:51.090
...so you wouldn't know about
the two Katsuura's!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.070
Well, it was partly my fault for not
realizing it along the way, but...

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.070
Guess we got carried away with
the drivin', you know!

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:11.780
So I'm a wimp...

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.480
...who's weak, and can't take the pressure
when the going gets tough.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:17.220
I got no guts, I'm slow,
I'm a sissy...

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:22.850
And on top of that, I'm also a klutz, an
oaf, and a dimwit... I'm hopeless!

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:29.160
Nakajima! Pathetic!
You're pathetic!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.630
T... Tsujimoto!

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:33.100
I'll cheer you up!

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:35.380
W... Wait a sec, Tsujimoto!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.010
Drink up and sing out in joy!
Go for it, Nakajima!

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:42.710
Eyaah! Knock it off, Tsujimoto!
We won't be able to go home!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.620
Let's booze it 'til daybreak!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.150
S... Somebody, save me!

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:47.260
You're not going anywhere!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:49.060
We'll get busted for DWI!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:50.790
Go for another bottle!

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:53.920
Phew! You reek of Sake!

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:57.130
"Katsuura Station"

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:57.260
Well, I better get going
from here...
"Katsuura Station"

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.630
Well, I better get going
from here...

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:01.760
I was hoping that we could go to
an aquarium or something.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.530
Too bad. Maybe next time, okay?

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:06.670
Next time, I'll introduce
you to my boyfriend!

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:26.390
At the very least... he's tall.

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:49.440
My! This is yesterday's
evening paper!

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:52.210
If she was going out, Natsumi could've
at least put it inside the apartment!

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:06.500
Miyuki... Is Nakajima home?

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:09.330
N... No. It seems
like he's out.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.410
How could he go out in
this kinda weather?!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:14.700
I just don't understand this
bike riding thing at all!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.670
Well, I notice that you're also
out and about, Yoriko!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.610
Yeah, well, I have a legitimate
excuse... souvenirs!

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:23.920
I'm like a rat in a trap, eh? Well, make
sure everyone gets a share, okay?

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.210
These are those famous
Peanut Rice-Cakes!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:31.020
I know! Though, I wonder where
Natsumi or Nakajima are...

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.120
Well, speak of the devil,
here's Nakajima now...

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.020
...and Natsumi?!

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.940
C... Coming home
in the morning?!

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:48.940
And? So, what happened?

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:53.170
Well, Nakajima and Tsujimoto went
out touring, and stayed overnight!

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:56.250
While Kobayakawa was out, right?
Is he flirting or something?

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:57.910
Well, I guess that's what
it boils down to.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.650
Hey, don't go around spreading
unsubstantiated rumors.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.790
Y... Yes, sir... Sorry
about that, sir!

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.780
The way I heard it, Nakajima's heart
was broken, and he just snapped...

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.020
...and asked Tsujimoto out.

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:09.520
Ah...

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.660
Allow me to explain...
if you would!

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:30.010
Ummm... Ahem! Er... Miyuki?
Got a minute?

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:31.120
It's okay.

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:32.020
It's okay.
Huh?

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:38.020
I know all about it. You were just trying
to cheer Nakajima up, right?

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:40.520
W... Well... something like that.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:43.930
Don't worry about it. Rumors
don't mean anything...

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.730
Oh! Miyuki, it's full!

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:51.810
Oh! Oh, my! Let me see here...
A rag! Where's a rag?!

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.110
"Health Checkup"
"Take Good Care
of Your Teeth"

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.020
I heard that you fell.

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:06.210
Y... Yeah. I think it has
to do with this fever...

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:07.910
Fever?! You have a cold
or something?

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:11.420
Uh... it's nothing much. I'm just a
little under the weather, I think...

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:14.220
Oh... Oh, yeah! Thanks
for the tasty souvenir!

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:17.260
I got them for everyone...

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:18.430
I got something for y...

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:20.920
I gotta get going now. Sorry...

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.200
"Notice of Personal Checkup"
"Bokuto Station"

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:26.900
I got something
for you, too...

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:32.170
She said not to worry about it, but I'm sure
she's lying. She looked so upset!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:35.280
I mean, it's weird NOT
to worry about it.

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:38.320
You just had to say something that was
totally uncalled for, didn't you?!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:41.320
Natsumi... don't be cruel!

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:48.330
Up 'til now, no matter how upset she was,
she never avoided me like this...

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:51.420
This is serious...

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:54.590
Good grief! I can't take
this anymore!

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:56.630
Wait, Tsujimoto! Where
are you going?!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.740
Someplace nice!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.400
Miyuki!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.940
Nakajima wants
to talk to you!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.880
Go on, tell her how
you really feel!

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.410
W... What?! Who, me?!

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:11.110
Come on! Tell her, like a
real man should! Do it!

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:12.270
B... But...

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:14.220
Why you!

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:16.550
Nakajima! Go for it!

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:20.150
Everyone's rooting for you! Now pluck up
your courage, and tell her how you feel!

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:21.390
Nakajima, go for it!

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:23.200
Yeah! Show her what you're made of!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.790
Do it, Nakajima!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.060
Yoriko... you're at it again!

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:29.830
But!

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:32.430
Miyuki, sorry... I didn't mean for
something like this to happen...

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:34.510
You're SO insensitive!

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:37.580
Leave me alone for
a while! Please?

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:52.420
Chief, here are today's reports, sir.
Please look through them.

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:54.120
This many?!

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.560
There's more, sir.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.600
Urk!

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:04.030
Natsumi, it's time
to go on patrol.

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:06.170
Oh, okay...

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:13.440
This sure is getting tense!

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:18.050
Our work gets done alright, but
at this rate, WE won't last!

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:22.010
This kind of a love triangle can't
be taken lightly at all!

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.330
I have to do something...

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:35.900
Your cold is getting
worse, isn't it?

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:37.370
I'm fine.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:40.140
If you say so...

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:52.550
You know, Miyuki... I know that I
can be insensitive sometimes...

00:21:52.650 --> 00:21:55.490
...'cause I can't figure certain things out
unless I'm told exactly what's what.

00:21:55.590 --> 00:21:57.820
And, I tend to go full speed ahead and
take my best shot, no matter what...

00:21:57.930 --> 00:22:00.190
I guess that's why I made
your life hell...

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:04.350
No. Maybe it's ME
who's insensitive.

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:06.800
You see, I don't even know
myself how I feel...

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:10.340
Why do two people
fall in love?

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:14.640
Isn't it because you feel that you
need that certain someone?

00:22:14.740 --> 00:22:18.970
But, "need" and "love" aren't
the same thing...

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:20.580
HUH?!

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:22.610
Sorry... I'm acting strange...

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:26.990
Miyuki!

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:29.460
Miyuki!
Alright!

00:22:31.060 --> 00:22:33.420
Uh-oh, the cops!

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:35.290
He's making a run for it!

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:37.660
He's probably laughing because
this is just a mini-patrol car.

00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:39.730
We won't let him get away!

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:47.460
Natsumi!

00:22:47.640 --> 00:22:49.630
Let me!

00:22:49.740 --> 00:22:51.110
Hey! Scram!

00:22:56.150 --> 00:22:58.710
Whew! Instant reaction! ...- SAFE! ...-
Such a close call!

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:00.220
Thanks, Natsumi.

00:23:00.390 --> 00:23:02.380
Don't mention it.

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:03.460
Kobayakawa...

00:23:03.460 --> 00:23:05.320
Kobayakawa...
Thanks... Nakajima...

00:23:05.490 --> 00:23:07.550
I'm not feeling
well today...

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:15.360
Oh, my! They're totally trashed! And this
was a new pair I just got issued!

00:23:23.240 --> 00:23:26.870
I'll go after that punk! You guys
take it easy for now. Adios!

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.410
Huh? HUH?!

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:32.780
Why are you taking over for us at
a time like this? You moron!

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:35.220
It's okay.

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:39.880
Nakajima needs
to be like that...

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:42.390
"Japanese Word Processor" "A4 Paper Size" "40 Lines"
"Schedule Proposal"

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:48.830
Recently, we've suffered the undesirable
consequences of a non-trivial situation.

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:52.200
I'm sure that both of you know
all too well what's causing it.

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:54.570
And so, as your chief, I must
officially inform you that...

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:56.640
...you, Miyuki Kobayakawa,
and you, Ken Nakajima...

00:23:56.740 --> 00:23:58.040
...in the hopes that you will
regain your friendship...

00:23:58.150 --> 00:24:00.880
...are hereby ordered to go
on a date this weekend!

00:24:00.980 --> 00:24:01.680
Here is your itinerary.

00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:03.020
"Schedule"
"Here I schedule the date ofMiss Kobayakawa and
Mr. Nakajimain order to resolve their issues."

00:24:03.020 --> 00:24:05.890
I expect you to scrutinize it carefully
and follow it as exactly as possible!

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:07.190
Yes, sir!

00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:09.160
Uh...

00:24:13.890 --> 00:24:16.520
"Meet her by the Kinshi train
station, at 3 P. M..."

00:24:16.700 --> 00:24:18.670
Nakajima...

00:24:20.870 --> 00:24:24.200
Kobayakawa... I hope
this works out for us!

00:24:24.540 --> 00:24:26.200
M... Me too...

00:24:36.150 --> 00:24:38.120
"Bill to: Bokuto Police Station"

00:24:40.920 --> 00:24:43.480
Uh... uh... next is
Kinshi Park...

00:24:44.530 --> 00:24:48.220
Ostrich 1 to all officers; the subjects are
heading towards the final destination!

00:24:48.860 --> 00:24:52.420
They are behaving informally. Date is
proceeding according to plan. Over!

00:24:52.600 --> 00:24:55.190
Roger! Natsumi? Yoriko?
Did you get that?

00:24:55.640 --> 00:24:57.630
Roger! And now, we
get to see the finale!

00:24:58.570 --> 00:25:00.600
They've just passed "Checkpoint
Charlie!" Over!

00:25:01.180 --> 00:25:04.080
Confirmed sighting of the subjects!
I shall continue the stakeout.

00:25:09.050 --> 00:25:13.150
I feel bad, making you hang out with me
all day, when you've just been sick...

00:25:13.320 --> 00:25:15.450
You shouldn't, because I'm
perfectly fine now.

00:25:15.560 --> 00:25:17.520
Oh, yeah!

00:25:18.160 --> 00:25:20.150
I've washed it for
you. Thanks!

00:25:21.500 --> 00:25:25.960
I... 'cause Tsujimoto told me... NO!
I mean, I wanted you to have this!

00:25:26.470 --> 00:25:29.160
YES! Good going! "Love
Shall Flourish!"

00:25:29.340 --> 00:25:30.860
"Traffic Safety?"

00:25:31.270 --> 00:25:31.860
WHAT?!

00:25:32.040 --> 00:25:35.570
We're in the traffic safety
department, after all!

00:25:36.480 --> 00:25:39.450
Even though we were ordered to be
here, I'm happy that this happened.

00:25:39.610 --> 00:25:41.170
Me, too.

00:25:44.080 --> 00:25:46.380
Thank you, Nakajima.

00:25:51.160 --> 00:25:53.920
Don't you wanna peek?
It's looking good!

00:25:54.090 --> 00:25:56.060
Oh, well...

00:26:04.940 --> 00:26:07.640
We've just been notified of a car crash
in front of the train station.

00:26:07.810 --> 00:26:10.540
Everyone, abort the current operation
and head over to the scene. Over.

00:26:11.080 --> 00:26:13.050
Roger!

00:26:14.050 --> 00:26:14.850
Time for work!

00:26:14.850 --> 00:26:16.820
Time for work!
Okay, let's go!

00:26:17.450 --> 00:26:20.680
Wait, Nakajima!

00:26:21.060 --> 00:26:21.990
<i>After the rain, scattered diamonds come.</i>

00:26:21.990 --> 00:26:24.490
Natsumi! You're over there, aren't you?
C'mon, let's get going!

00:26:24.490 --> 00:26:24.630
<i>After the rain, scattered diamonds come.</i>

00:26:24.630 --> 00:26:25.530
S... Sure!

00:26:25.530 --> 00:26:26.290
<i>After the rain, scattered diamonds come.</i>

00:26:26.290 --> 00:26:27.430
Right! Yoriko, you take care of the stuff!

00:26:27.430 --> 00:26:29.260
<i>We'll be crossing bridges of rainbows...</i>

00:26:29.260 --> 00:26:31.230
It was just getting good!

00:26:31.230 --> 00:26:31.730
<i>... nonstop, no matter what we face.</i>

00:26:31.730 --> 00:26:34.940
Yahoo! Well... we just happened
to be walking nearby, and...

00:26:34.940 --> 00:26:36.070
<i>I don't like chicken-hearted softies... You're Under Arrest!</i>

00:26:36.070 --> 00:26:44.710
<i>Next time... ask me out without the</i>
<i>plan and without the entourage!</i>

00:26:44.710 --> 00:26:44.740
<i>I don't like chicken-hearted softies... You're Under Arrest!</i>

00:27:07.370 --> 00:27:15.710
<i>I love the smile you always have.</i>
<i>With all the passion I have...</i>

00:27:15.780 --> 00:27:25.110
<i>... I will protect you from sighs.</i>

00:27:25.220 --> 00:27:33.060
<i>The sunset skyline flashes past</i>
<i>in my side-view mirror.</i>

00:27:33.130 --> 00:27:40.620
<i>This is the road I drive on every day,</i>
<i>believing in my dreams.</i>

00:27:40.730 --> 00:27:48.530
<i>On rainy days, windy days, and days</i>
<i>when I wanted to throw it all away...</i>

00:27:48.640 --> 00:27:56.370
<i>... you smiled as you</i>
<i>sat beside me.</i>

00:27:57.650 --> 00:28:02.160
<i>I love the unchanging vista, the sky</i>
<i>that we watch together.</i>

00:28:06.160 --> 00:28:12.970
<i>That's why I'm confident that I can</i>
<i>hang in there, if it's for you.</i>

00:28:13.030 --> 00:28:21.470
<i>I love the smile you always have.</i>
<i>With all the passion I have...</i>

00:28:21.540 --> 00:28:21.680
<i>... I will protect you from sighs.</i>

00:28:28.020 --> 00:28:28.050
<i>I love this town where we</i>
<i>happened to meet...</i>

00:28:41.200 --> 00:28:41.700
"And Speaking of
Our Heroines..."

00:28:41.700 --> 00:28:46.260
Natsumi, it was a short year being your
partner and all, but it was great fun!

00:28:46.370 --> 00:28:47.590
I'll never forget you!

00:28:47.770 --> 00:28:50.860
Huh? Miyuki, you make it
sound like a farewell.

00:28:51.040 --> 00:28:52.910
Natsumi! Don't go! Waah!

00:28:52.910 --> 00:28:54.170
"Go?!" Where to?!

00:28:54.340 --> 00:28:56.470
Tsujimoto! It won't be the
same without you!

00:28:56.580 --> 00:28:58.200
Take care! Here's a Going-
Away present!

00:28:58.380 --> 00:28:59.940
All of us at Bokuto Police Station
are proud of you guys.

00:29:00.050 --> 00:29:01.880
We look forward to seeing you triumph
in your future endeavors!

00:29:02.050 --> 00:29:05.140
See you again in You're Under Arrest,
File 4, "On The Road, Again."

00:29:05.250 --> 00:29:06.650
Natsumi! It's our last assignment!

00:29:06.820 --> 00:29:11.050
Oh, I don't know what's going on,
but I'll take my best shot at it!
